WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,840 --> 00:00:08,080
Miss Jian, please get off the car

2
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:14,140
I called the police again

3
00:00:18,730 --> 00:00:20,850
Can you open the door now?

4
00:00:20,970 --> 00:00:23,210
Get off the car. I'm not with you anymore. Hurry up.

5
00:00:23,330 --> 00:00:27,420
Get off the car and don’t make me say it a second time

6
00:00:28,270 --> 00:00:30,310
You know what will happen if you mess with me

7
00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:41,010
Come here, when are you so excited to cut off the eldest lady?

8
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:45,160
With a small taxi, the four muscles are humiliated and the body is incomplete

9
00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:47,180
And he kept admitting that he was wrong

10
00:00:49,370 --> 00:00:50,850
You sent someone to follow me

11
00:00:51,580 --> 00:00:52,540
Not too big

12
00:00:54,090 --> 00:00:56,700
Master, are you asking me

13
00:00:56,820 --> 00:00:58,140
Did I steal something?

14
00:00:58,140 --> 00:01:01,480
Or did you rob someone else? Mission

15
00:01:03,690 --> 00:01:05,530
I killed the woman he loved most

16
00:01:05,530 --> 00:01:06,850
my best friend
